<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-051" chapter-id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family" source-id="s-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family-ws1959959">
  <p id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p001:m0000" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAB">道憐</persName>六子：義欣、義慶、義融、<persName id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p001:m0014" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AABB">義宗</persName>、義賓、義綦。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">義融弟<persName id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p002:m0003" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AABB">義宗</persName>，幼爲髙祖所愛，字曰<persName id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p002:m0015" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AABB">伯奴</persName>，賜爵新渝縣男。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子懷侯玠嗣，琅邪、秦郡太守。爲元凶所殺，追贈散騎常侍。無子，弟<persName id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p003:m0031" ref="jgo_o5m_l1f">秉</persName>以子承繼封。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p004:m0000" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AABB">義宗</persName>子 <persName id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p004:m0004" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AABBA">遐</persName></p>
  <p id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p005" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">謨弟<persName id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p005:m0002" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AABBA">遐</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p005:m0004" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AABBA">彦道</persName>，亦奉朝請、員外散騎侍郎。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p006" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">兄<persName id="c-songshu-051-yizong-xia-family:p006:m0001" ref="jgo_o5m_l1f">秉</persName>既死，齊王遣誅之。</p>
</text>
